wo shehar -e- shaam wo darbar rang raeesana<br>
wo jaho aur wo hasham wo yazidiyat ki ana<br>
mila ke qaak mein sab ko lo aayee hain zainab<br>
manane bhai ke chehlum ko ayee hai zainab	<br>
bala utha ke sitam seh ke ayee hai zainab<br>
<br>
1. behan ne dekha gala kat te bhai ka ran mein<br>
yateem hona sakina ka chote se sin mein<br>
har imtehaan ko sar kar ke ayee hain zainab<br>
<br>
2. ajeeb haal mein qasim ki laash ko dekha<br>
falak ko tuthte kubra ke haal par dekha<br>
nazar mein yaas ke aalam bhi layee hai zainab<br>
<br>
3. kaata ke haatho ko ghazi jo nehar par soya<br>
sukon -e- qalb bhi bhai bhi chain bhi khoya<br>
aur apne saath alam lekar ayee hain zainab<br>
<br>
4. sina jo akbar -e- mehro ne khayi thi ran mein<br>
guzar gaye the jo athara saal ke sin mein<br>
wo daag dil pe liye ban mein ayee hai zainab<br>
<br>
5. raha na koi bhi jab ghar ke paas bani ko<br>
khud uth khadi huwi zainab nighaha bani ko<br>
wo banke hazrat-e- abbas ayee hain zainab<br>
<br>
6. ada wo kare hussaini kiya hain zainab ne<br>
ali ke lehje mein khutba diya hain zainab ne<br>
gham-e- hussain ka atiha bhi laayi hain zainab<br>
<br>
7. gale pe khake jo teer -e- sitam gaye asghar<br>
sukon ma ka bhi humrah le gaye asghar<br>
wo ek nanha sa jhula bhi layi hain zainab<br>
<br>
8. bana ke shaam ke zindan mein nanhi si turbat<br>
nishan rasan ke kayi daag pusht pe sarwat<br>
baraye ahle watan kuch to laayi hain zainab